          Not every pressure-treated deck or fence needs color — some just need to stop cupping, splitting, and warping while keeping that natural PT tone visible. We tested clear and semi-clear waterproofing sealers on modern ACQ lumber for a full year to find out which ones actually bond to today's copper-heavy treatment chemistry and which ones haze, peel, or fail.
