    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-4">In This Guide</h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#acq-chemistry" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. Why Modern ACQ Lumber Needs a Different Sealer</a>
          <a href="#wait-time" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. How Long to Wait Before Sealing New PT</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. Our 6 Top Sealers Reviewed</a>
          <a href="#how-to-seal" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. How to Seal Treated Lumber</a>
